=====Usage notes=====
''Sì'' is solely used to join verbs/sentences and not nouns, for which {{m|yo|ati|àti}} is used. Additionally, when ''sì'' is used, the subject of each verb must be specified.
# Mo jó, mo kọ́ ẹ̀kọ́, mo '''sì''' kọ lẹ́tà. – ''I danced, studied, and wrote a letter.''
# Wọn kò fẹ́ ṣiṣẹ́, wọn kò '''sì''' fẹ́ ṣeré. – ''They don't want to work or play.''

